            "\n"
            "### PSD3 / Verification-of-Payee (VoP) ingestion adapter · *data/psd3/*\n"
            "\n"
            "**5 days · IMPACT/EFFORT: MED-HIGH**\n"
            "\n"
            "PSD3 + PSR are expected in the Official Journal end-Q2 2026, with VoP / payee-name-match liability applying 24 months after entry into force ([Norton Rose Fulbright PSD3 brief](https://www.nortonrosefulbright.com/en/knowledge/publications/cedd39c6/psd3-and-psr-from-provisional-agreement-to-2026-readiness)). Lands a payments-ops persona that today has no OSS option. **Why now:** the 2-year clock is the right window for a reference implementation to exist before banks have to procure one.\n"
