            "**DATA-5 · In-bank, not SaaS (data sovereignty)** — **Page**: Data Integration · source catalogue — the deployment topology IS the source list. **Deploy**: Docker / Helm. **Module**: `data/sources.py` (no SaaS dependency in any loader).\n"
