            "\n"
            "**DATA-11 · Spec as data contract (versioned, hashable)** — **Page**: Audit & Evidence — spec hash on every run. **CLI**: `aml validate` (JSON Schema + Pydantic two-layer). **Module**: `spec/loader.py` + `engine/audit.py` (hash-chained ledger).\n"
